 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and roles
+
+Send `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Keys are `apiKeys: [{ key, name, role }]`
+in the data (a migrated file has none; add them). Roles: `viewer` (GET only),
+`cook` (also `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+`POST /temperatures`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`), `manager` (everything).
+No or unknown key: 401 `unauthorized`; not allowed: 403 `forbidden`.
+
+Every authenticated request that changes data (not GET) adds an audit entry
+`{ id, at, key, method, path, status }`. Route: `GET /audit` lists them newest
+first (managers only).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
